Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2020 18:21:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] Patch for buildroot integration

1. Support lite make
2. Support microlite make
3. Support microlite optimized kernel
4. Suppress Werror and Wno-init warning for compile failure
5. Add test buildroot mk template
---
